{
  "_about": "The Orbit contract for POC Studio, read from orbit.uat on 2026-10-15. Every write goes through orbit-api.mjs, which maps each internal value through `map` to the Orbit value, then checks the whole record against the live schema (required fields, field names, options, reference ids) before sending. `schema-check` compares this file with the live tenant; `contract-test` writes every mapped value on the real tenant and reads it back. Change a value here and nowhere else.",
